00:18:24,620 --> 00:18:29,057
It's just you, me, and the most powerful
magic card that's ever been created.

255
00:18:29,140 --> 00:18:30,180
I know.

256
00:18:30,460 --> 00:18:31,980
I was expecting this.

257
00:18:32,660 --> 00:18:35,484
Now that the Seal of Ori
Kalkos is on the field,

258
00:18:35,700 --> 00:18:39,160
the evil that controls Mai
just got ten times stronger.

259
00:18:39,600 --> 00:18:41,937
But I know the real Mai
is in there somewhere.

260
00:18:42,020 --> 00:18:45,380
And I'm gonna set her free,
no matter what it takes.

261
00:18:46,020 --> 00:18:46,850
All right.

262
00:18:47,040 --> 00:18:49,540
Now I summon another Cyber Harpy.

263
00:18:49,780 --> 00:18:51,839
That's two if you're keeping score.

264
00:18:53,920 --> 00:18:56,557
And thanks to my shiny new magic card,

265
00:18:56,640 --> 00:19:00,520
Each of my Harpies gets an
extra 500 attack points now.

266
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:03,220
Harpy attack!

267
00:19:03,740 --> 00:19:06,980
Tear his gator to shreds
with Shadownail Slice!

268
00:19:15,220 --> 00:19:18,900
And now, it's monster number two's turn!

269
00:19:19,360 --> 00:19:20,960
Hold your Harpies.

270
00:19:21,600 --> 00:19:22,980
Go, scapegoat!

271
00:19:23,140 --> 00:19:25,397
You'll have to go through
them to get to me.

272
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:30,300
You use that card every duel, so
forgive me for not being shot.

273
00:19:31,380 --> 00:19:34,640
Reveal trap card, Nightmare Tri-Mirror.

274
00:19:38,340 --> 00:19:42,097
It casts a reflection of your
four scapegoats. After that,

275
00:19:42,180 --> 00:19:46,497
it transforms that reflection into four
new monsters on my side of the field.

276
00:19:46,580 --> 00:19:51,840
That means thanks to you, I now have four
more cyber harpies to add to my flock.

277
00:20:03,820 --> 00:20:04,940
Cyber Harpy!

278
00:20:05,260 --> 00:20:06,980
Crush his scapegoat token!

279
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:16,800
Lucky for you, my four new Harpies
can't attack until next turn.

280
00:20:17,060 --> 00:20:19,380
So I'll take a break. For now.

281
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:22,117
But you better think of
some new tricks, Wheeler.

282
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:24,437
Because I've seen all
of your moves before.

283
00:20:24,520 --> 00:20:30,697
you hear me loud and clear and don't worry
i got a few new twists planned you should

284
00:20:30,780 --> 00:20:36,237
know by now your bluffs don't work on me
you're going down and i'm going straight

285
00:20:36,320 --> 00:20:42,537
to the top there's nowhere to run wheeler
don't worry i don't plan on running

286
00:20:42,620 --> 00:20:48,380
away i'm gonna keep fighting until i break
through to you my or lose my soul trying

287
00:20:54,840 --> 00:20:56,240
Yo!
